<view wx:if="{{isDev}}" class="review-page">
  <nav-bar title="四项验收台"></nav-bar>
  <scroll-view class="review-scroll" scroll-y>
    <view class="review-hero">
      <view class="review-kicker"><view class="review-kicker__dot"></view><text>CORE LOOP · DEV REVIEW</text></view>
      <text class="review-title">只验证一条陪伴闭环</text>
      <text class="review-intro">从今天的相处出发，收下一颗星星，看见明天的线索，最后留下一段纪念。</text>
      <view class="review-status" aria-label="开发验收边界">
        <text>LOCAL FIXTURE</text><view class="review-status__divider"></view><text>NO BACKEND</text>
      </view>
      <text class="review-warning">开发状态独立验收 · 正式用户不可见</text>
    </view>

    <view class="flow-label"><text>验收顺序</text><text>4 个保留项</text></view>
    <view class="core-flow">
      <view
        wx:for="{{coreItems}}"
        wx:key="key"
        class="core-card core-card--{{item.tone}}"
        aria-role="button"
        aria-label="打开{{item.title}}"
        data-key="{{item.key}}"
        bindtap="onOpenItem"
      >
        <view class="core-card__rail">
          <text class="core-card__step">{{item.step}}</text>
          <view wx:if="{{index < coreItems.length - 1}}" class="core-card__line"></view>
        </view>
        <view class="core-card__body">
          <view class="core-card__head">
            <view class="core-card__symbol"><text>{{item.symbol}}</text></view>
            <text class="core-card__meta">{{item.meta}}</text>
          </view>
          <text class="core-card__title">{{item.title}}</text>
          <text class="core-card__summary">{{item.summary}}</text>
          <view class="core-card__action"><text>打开验收</text><text class="core-card__arrow">→</text></view>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="scope-note">
      <text class="scope-note__label">本轮边界</text>
      <text class="scope-note__copy">不含奖励揭晓、广告、独立合规页；纪念册已暂停，只保留最简单的列表验收入口。</text>
    </view>
    <view class="safe-space"></view>
  </scroll-view>
</view>
